              {
                "scalar": {
                  "kind": "integer",
                  "value": 3
                }
              }
            ]
          ]
        }
      },
      "comment": "C-11: the later value replaces the earlier `1`; because that value is an array it contributes its elements as usual, so the result is two edges, `(a,2)` and `(a,3)`, not one. The earlier value leaves no trace."
    },
